// Vitest Snapshot v1, https://vitest.dev/guide/snapshot.html

exports[`renderTranscript (rebuild prompt body, ADR-0003) > renders user/assistant text, tool calls as delimited past-tool-call records, images as [image]; system messages are excluded; never the imitable [tool pi__ shape 1`] = `
"[user]
hello there

[assistant]
Hi! Let me check.
--- past tool call pi__read ---
{"path":"/tmp/x"}
--- end past tool call ---

--- past tool result pi__read (call-1) ---
file contents here
--- end past tool result ---

[user]
and an image:
[image]"
`;
